cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "FLY-SURFER"
abstract: >-
  Connectome-derived spiking neural simulation of a fruit fly brain driving a
  game controller. The repository contains the perception, sensory encoding,
  simulation, motor decoding and plasticity stack, the pre-registered
  experimental protocols, and the recorded results, including a fully documented
  negative result: at the recorded operating point the simulated motor
  populations produced zero spikes.
authors:
